Pr oposition 3PR OVIDES PERMANENT FUNDING FOR SCHOOLS AND HE AL TH CARE BY EXTENDING EXISTING TAX ON HIGH INC OMES. INITIA TIVE CONSTITUTIONAL AMENDMENT .

Makes permanent existing voter -approved tax rates for individuals earning over $371,000 (adjusted annually for inflation). Allocates tax revenues to public education. Fiscal Imp act: Maintains $5 billion to $15 billion of annual state income tax revenue by making a temporary tax increase on high -income earners permanent instead of letting it expire in 2031. Su ppor ters: 

